From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tile-view <tile-view@localhost>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 18:44:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/27] Mobile: Use masonry layout for the tile view

Replace the fixed-grid FlatList (numColumns) with a ScrollView containing
one row of independent column Views. Notes are distributed round-robin
into the columns, as in the original plugin, so each tile keeps its
natural height instead of being stretched to match the tallest tile in
its row.

